## Why This Is Asked
Probes end-to-end Azure data pipelines with tenant isolation, idempotency, governance, and rollback.

## Key Concepts
- Durable Functions orchestration and replay safety
- Cosmos DB partitioning by tenantId
- CMK in Key Vault and envelope encryption
- Data governance with Purview; search with Cognitive Search
- Feature flags and canary testing for rule changes

## Code Example
